          "html": "<pre class=\"shiki css-variables\" style=\"background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">String</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> x </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> null</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">x </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">==</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> null</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">;                    </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">// 判空只有这一种写法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">int</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> n;                        </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">// ⚠ 基本类型不能为 null：字段默认 0，局部必须赋值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">Integer</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\"> boxed </span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> null</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">// int y = boxed;             // —— ⚠ NullPointerException —— 拆箱时才炸</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">java</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">util</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\">Optional</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">ofNullable</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">(x)</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-punctuation)\">.</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\">orElse</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)\">\"默认\"</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">);</span></span></code></pre>",
          "lineCount": 8,
          "notes": [
            {
              "line": 4,
              "text": "基本类型不能为 null：字段默认 0，局部必须赋值",
              "tone": "warn"
            },
            {
              "line": 6,
              "text": "NullPointerException —— 拆箱时才炸",
